llingSumOfMeToo":23.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1050719261956685824","date":1539345968000,"rawContent":"Bei der #metoo-Debatte geht es nicht nur um k\u00f6rperliche und\/oder sexuelle, sondern im Kern um psychische Gewalt, die mit #Narzissmus einhergeht. Narzissmus ist mit patriarchalem Denken (Verletzlichkeit = Tabu) verwoben, doch nicht mit M\u00e4nnern. Auch Frauen sind diesem unterworfen.","userId":108068653,"media":null,"username":"JulieAneT","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":24.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":40,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":24.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1050721660784009217","date":1539346540000,"rawContent":"#metoo isn't only about physical or sexual violence but also (in its core) about psychic violence (linked to #narcissism). Narcissism is linked to patriarchal thinking (vulnerability = taboo), but not only associated with men. Also women are subjected to patriarchal thinking.","userId":108068653,"media":null,"username":"JulieAneT","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":25.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":41,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":25.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1050726104858861573","date":1539347599000,"rawContent":"#metoo\nTake that, mimimimi-men!\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/mup5rQbEHE","userId":108068653,"media":null,"username":"JulieAneT","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":26.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":42,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":26.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1050727849198530560","date":1539348015000,"rawContent":"#metoo\nThe most disgusting abuse is when someone treats someone as an object he\/she  uses like he\/she wants. That's the core of violence. And this belongs to a system where patriarchal thinking and #narcissism are praised. And this is the absence of love!","userId":108068653,"media":null,"username":"JulieAneT","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":27.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":43,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":27.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1050731543856144384","date":1539348896000,"rawContent":"#metoo\n\"Diese Herren an der Spitze sind die einzigen echten Nutznie\u00dfer des  #Patriarchats. In diesem stark hierarchisierten System stehen nur wenige  Sieger ganz oben, daf\u00fcr aber gibt es sehr viele Verlierer...\" https:\/\/t.co\/ILYmFb43A3","userId":108068653,"media":null,"username":"JulieAneT","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":28.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":44,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":28.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1050738184785674240","date":1539350479000,"rawContent":"#metoo\nWomen shouldn't have to behave like men to embody potency and their potential. The other way round: They should have the possibility to embody their femininity to show their full potential!","userId":108068653,"media":null,"username":"JulieAneT","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":29.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLiv